{"meta":{"engine":"This is LuaHBTeX, Version 1.21.0 (TeX Live 2025)","format":"lualatex"},"params":{"textwidth":22609920,"textheight":36044800,"topskip":[655360,0,0,0,0],"parskip":[0,65536,0,0,0],"parindent":983040,"baselineskip":[786432,0,0,0,0],"oddsidemargin":4063232,"topmargin":1048576,"headheight":786432,"headsep":1638400,"footskip":1966080,"maxdepth":327680,"widowpenalty":150,"clubpenalty":150},"pages":[{"number":1,"pagewidth":40258437,"pageheight":52099153,"lines":[{"x":8799518,"y":11617566,"w":22609920,"h":798386,"d":233287,"text":" Pages from Lines "},{"x":18059362,"y":13518110,"w":4090233,"h":642250,"d":275254,"text":" A. Writer "},{"x":8799518,"y":15060044,"w":22609920,"h":545784,"d":17302,"text":" 3 March 2025 "},{"x":8799518,"y":17419340,"w":22609920,"h":411697,"d":3539,"text":" Abstract "},{"x":10437918,"y":18500684,"w":19333120,"h":422314,"d":121504,"text":" A typesetting system takes a description of a document and decides"},{"x":10437918,"y":19221580,"w":19333120,"h":409338,"d":121504,"text":"where every character goes. It breaks paragraphs into lines, stacks the lines"},{"x":10437918,"y":19942476,"w":19333120,"h":415826,"d":121504,"text":"into pages and places headings, notes and figures where the reader expects"},{"x":10437918,"y":20663372,"w":19333120,"h":415826,"d":120914,"text":"them. Each of these steps follows rules that can be written down precisely,"},{"x":10437918,"y":21384268,"w":19333120,"h":415826,"d":121504,"text":"and a good program follows them exactly. "},{"x":8799518,"y":23552526,"w":22609920,"h":657771,"d":10381,"text":"Contents "},{"x":8799518,"y":24994318,"w":22609920,"h":454820,"d":3932,"text":" 1 Introduction 1 "},{"x":8799518,"y":26436110,"w":22609920,"h":454820,"d":7209,"text":" 2 Results 1 "},{"x":8799518,"y":27222542,"w":22609920,"h":447611,"d":7209,"text":" 2.1 More 2 "},{"x":8799518,"y":29390800,"w":22609920,"h":654940,"d":5662,"text":"1 Introduction "},{"x":8799518,"y":30826890,"w":22609920,"h":462029,"d":135004,"text":"Lines of a paragraph are chosen together rather than one at a time. The program"},{"x":8799518,"y":31613322,"w":22609920,"h":462029,"d":135004,"text":"looks at every way of breaking the paragraph and picks the one whose lines are"},{"x":8799518,"y":32399754,"w":22609920,"h":454820,"d":135004,"text":"spaced most evenly, avoiding hyphens on consecutive lines and very loose lines"},{"x":8799518,"y":33186186,"w":22609920,"h":543354,"d":135004,"text":"next to very tight ones.1 "},{"x":10437918,"y":34496906,"w":20971520,"h":454820,"d":135004,"text":" • Lines are chosen together. "},{"x":10437918,"y":35807626,"w":20971520,"h":454820,"d":135004,"text":" • Pages are built one line at a time. "},{"x":8799518,"y":37975884,"w":22609920,"h":654940,"d":10381,"text":"2 Results "},{"x":8799518,"y":39411974,"w":22609920,"h":462029,"d":134349,"text":"Theorem 1. Every page is a box of lines. "},{"x":8799518,"y":40722694,"w":22609920,"h":462029,"d":134349,"text":" Proof. By construction, see Section 1. "},{"x":8799518,"y":41893779,"w":22609920,"h":446912,"d":108003,"text":" 1Notes at the foot of a page are collected separately from the main text. They take space"},{"x":8799518,"y":42516371,"w":22609920,"h":369623,"d":108003,"text":"from the page they appear on, and when there are too many some of them move to the next"},{"x":8799518,"y":43138963,"w":22609920,"h":363856,"d":186779,"text":"page, keeping their order and their numbers. "},{"x":8799518,"y":46220574,"w":22609920,"h":436470,"d":0,"text":" 1 "}],"body":{"width":22609920,"height":36044800,"depth":0,"glueSign":1,"glueOrder":2,"glueSet":159361.578,"items":[["o","whatsit"],["glue",655360,0,0,0,0,10],["h",0,0,0,0,""],["glue",1310720,0,0,0,0,0],["glue",-1310720,0,0,0,0,0],["p",-51],["glue",1310720,0,0,0,0,0],["glue",0,65536,0,0,0,3],["glue",0,0,0,0,0,3],["glue",643406,0,0,0,0,2],["h",22609920,798386,233287,0," Pages from Lines "],["glue",983040,0,0,0,0,0],["glue",0,65536,0,0,0,3],["glue",0,0,0,0,0,3],["glue",41967,0,0,0,0,2],["h",2